{"id":"688a1b544d81033c","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ajtai-fagin-game.md","title":"Ajtai–Fagin 游戏的获胜谓词","display":"df-ajtai-fagin-game — Ajtai–Fagin 游戏的获胜谓词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game","aliases":["29-df-ajtai-fagin-game"],"display":"df-ajtai-fagin-game — Ajtai–Fagin 游戏的获胜谓词","depends_on":["[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 8.4, p.127, DjVu scan 142","source_basis":"原书五阶段玩法已逐项比对；以下显式参数化允许输入论域及胜方查询"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ajtai-fagin-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ajtai-fagin-game — Ajtai–Fagin 游戏的获胜谓词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa169cf9db0afb60\" href=\"?note=fa169cf9db0afb60\" title=\"29-df-monadic-so-game\">29-df-monadic-so-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 8.4, p.127, DjVu scan 142"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书五阶段玩法已逐项比对；以下显式参数化允许输入论域及胜方查询"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq K\">\\(I\\subseteq K\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 同构封闭，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in I\\leftrightarrow B\\in I))\">\\(\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in I\\leftrightarrow B\\in I))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}\">\\(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_m\">\\(G_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fa169cf9db0afb60\" href=\"?note=fa169cf9db0afb60\" title=\"29-df-monadic-so-game\">29-df-monadic-so-game</a> 的相同接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\">\\(\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\)</span> 表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的一元关系元组空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists A\\in I\\;\\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists B\\in K\\setminus I\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists A\\in I\\;\\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists B\\in K\\setminus I\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 8.4，印刷页127、扫描页142。其顺序是 Samson 选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,m\">\\(c,m\\)</span>；Delilah 选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in I\">\\(A\\in I\\)</span>；Samson 着色 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；Delilah 根据这一着色选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\notin I\">\\(B\\notin I\\)</span> 并着色；最后玩 FO 游戏。本条的量词顺序完整保留这一信息结构。尤其不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的选择放到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 着色之前。有限完美信息阶段的策略回溯给出上式；外层量词把每个初始参数选择的回应合在一个获胜策略中。</p>\n<p>原书取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(K=\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；相对输入域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是本库的显式一般化，用于无向图或带序图。每一步都在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中选择结构。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span> 不改变全局获胜条件：若可赢任意正轮数，当然可赢零轮；反向是去掉一个要求。非空结构保证 EF 局面可延长，因此该省略没有空域例外。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-monadic-so-game","status":"resolved","id":"fa169cf9db0afb60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇；$K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$I\\subseteq K$。$K$ 同构封闭，且 $\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in I\\leftrightarrow B\\in I))$；$\\cong$ 见 [[29-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-so-game","status":"resolved","id":"fa169cf9db0afb60","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}$、$G_m$、$\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m$ 取 [[29-df-monadic-so-game]] 的相同接口；$\\mathcal P(|A|)^c$ 表示长度 $c$ 的一元关系元组空间。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in I\\leftrightarrow B\\in I))","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}","display":false},{"tex":"G_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(|A|)^c","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists A\\in I\\;\\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists B\\in K\\setminus I\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"c,m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\notin I","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":2161,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]、[[29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]、[[29-thm-monadic-connectivity]] — Ajtai–Fagin 判据、无序与仅带序的连通性下界"},{"id":"93bcfaaefa338233","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇；$K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$I\\subseteq K$，$K$ 同构封闭且 $I$ 在 $K$ 中同构不变，满足 [[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]] 的输入条件。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ajtai-fagin-game|29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]"}],"outgoing":["fa169cf9db0afb60","3a603dc4f41b07de"]}